WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.026
Today we will notice how art can carry cultural meaning. Our work connects with

00:00:05.026 --> 00:00:06.749
Ghanaian and other African artists.

00:00:07.617 --> 00:00:10.795
Look at a cloth pattern and point to its repeated marks.

00:00:11.617 --> 00:00:16.315
Sketch two repeated shapes from the cloth onto paper. Record why your chosen

00:00:16.315 --> 00:00:17.761
technique suits the message.

00:00:18.617 --> 00:00:22.350
Add one personal variation and explain what it represents.
